(The land is dry and cracked\054 but she has found water\056 She) Tj
T*
(kneels at the old stone well and fills what she can\054 knowing that) Tj
T*
(tonight a whole family will drink because she walked here) Tj
T*
(today\056 She will not tell anyone it was hard\056) Tj
