(In so many homes\054 a mother is the one quietly carrying the) Tj
T*
(water\072 the schedules\054 the savings\054 the worry\056 This Mother\047s) Tj
T*
(Day\054 the best gift may be making sure her load is protected\072 a) Tj
T*
(plan if income stops\054 a home that is secure\054 and a family that) Tj
T*
(knows how much she carries\056) Tj
